# textdomain: smartshop
for sale:=出售：
price:=价格：
customer view=顾客视图
view the shop as a customer=以顾客身份查看商店
strict meta?=严格元数据？
check this if you are buying or selling items with unique properties like written books or petz.=如果你买卖具有独特属性的物品（例如写过的书或宠物），请勾选此项。
private?=私人？
uncheck this if you want to share control of the shop with anyone in the protected area.=如果你希望与受保护区域内的其他玩家共享商店控制权，请取消勾选。
freebies?=免费？
check this if you want to be able to give/receive items without an exchange=如果你希望能够在不进行交换的情况下赠送或接收物品，请勾选此项
unlimited?=无限？
check this allow exchanges ex nihilo. shop contents will be ignored=勾选此项以允许凭空进行交换。商店库存将被忽略
purchase history=购买记录
view a log of purchases from the shop=查看商店购买记录
Stock is unlimited=库存无限
refill=补充
send=发送
payments sent to @1=付款发送至 @1
click to set send storage=点击设置付款存储
automatically refilled from @1=自动从 @1 补充
click to set refill storage=点击设置补充存储
used with connected smartshops=与已连接的 Smartshop 一起使用
save=保存
Private?=私人？
uncheck this if you want to share control of the storage with anyone in the protected area.=如果你希望与受保护区域内的其他玩家共享存储控制权，请取消勾选。
close history=关闭记录
@1 @2 bought @3 for @4=@1 @2 以 @4 购买了 @3
Smartshop=Smartshop
Smartshop external storage=Smartshop 外部存储
Shop by: @1=商店所有者：@1
(Smartshop by @1)=（Smartshop 所有者：@1）
This shop is over-full.=此商店已满。
This shop is sold out.=此商店已售罄。
This shop is not configured.=此商店尚未配置。
External storage by: @1=外部存储所有者：@1
Storage link attempt timed out, please try again.=连接存储的操作超时，请重试。
Punch a smartshop storage node to link @1 storage=击打一个 Smartshop 存储节点以连接 @1 存储
You do not own this storage!=你不是此存储的所有者！
Storage is too far from shop to link!=存储距离商店太远，无法连接！
@1 storage linked!=@1 存储已连接！
normal exchange=普通交换
Cannot exchange: You lack appropriate payment=无法交换：你没有合适的付款物品
Cannot exchange: Shop is sold out=无法交换：商店已售罄
Cannot exchange: No room in your inventory=无法交换：你的物品栏没有空间
Cannot exchange: Shop is full=无法交换：商店已满
Cannot exchange: Failed for unknown reason=无法交换：因未知原因失败
